# Quake OS

**Package:** `quake-os/` at repo root  
**Directive:** `quake-os/docs/OS-MASTER-DIRECTIVE.md`

## Before AMS features

1. `pnpm quake:os` — verify OS health
2. Read `quake-os/memory/tasks/` or legacy `data/quake-os/improvement-backlog.json`
3. Run wave: `pnpm quake:os:wave`

## Engines

| Engine | Module |
|--------|--------|
| Memory | `quake-os/core/memory-store.ts` |
| Tasks | `quake-os/core/task-engine.ts` |
| Research | `quake-os/core/research-engine.ts` |
| Audit | `quake-os/core/audit-engine.ts` |
| Planning | `quake-os/core/planning-engine.ts` |
| Improvement | `quake-os/core/improvement-engine.ts` |
| Knowledge graph | `quake-os/knowledge-graph/store.ts` |
| Orchestrator | `quake-os/orchestrator/index.ts` |

## Feature complete workflow

`runImprovementLoop()` → 8 review steps per `workflows/feature-complete.json`

## Agents

21 OS agents in `quake-os/agents/registry.json` — sync folders: `pnpm quake:agents:sync`
